Description: fate/hevc: test the mantissas of the 3D reference displays information
 .
 Decode an MP4 file whose hvcC box carries a 3D reference displays
 information SEI message with mantissas of 20, 30, 40 and 45 bits, the
 way a container passes such a message to the decoder, and check the
 values of the frame side data against the bits written.
 .
 The sample is made from the raw stream of the fate/cbs test by
 ffmpeg -c copy, with the SEI NAL unit also added to the hvcC box by
 the script attached to the pull request.
 .
 Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
